WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.709 --> 00:00:15.195
Tina: You made it!

2
00:00:15.876 --> 00:00:16.556
You're safe!

3
00:00:17.216 --> 00:00:18.897
Danny: No thanks to you!

4
00:00:18.917 --> 00:00:20.778
Brad: I don't know.

5
00:00:21.499 --> 00:00:22.619
I'm a little thankful.

6
00:00:22.639 --> 00:00:27.102
Danny: It was Tina who yelled and told the mites to chase us.

7
00:00:27.122 --> 00:00:30.584
Tina: I did it for your own good.

8
00:00:31.148 --> 00:00:33.189
Danny: Well, I didn't ask for your help.

9
00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:37.291
Bello: There's no time for fighting.

10
00:00:37.311 --> 00:00:40.533
Bello: Let's get out while the mites are trapped in the tower.

11
00:00:40.553 --> 00:00:43.755
Danny: Hopian, I can't believe it's you!

12
00:00:43.775 --> 00:00:50.879
Bello: But I'm not Hopian, Danny.

13
00:00:50.899 --> 00:00:53.120
Danny: I don't understand.

14
00:00:53.140 --> 00:00:55.642
Bello: It's me, Bello!

15
00:00:56.342 --> 00:00:57.403
Brad: Bello?

16
00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:02.661
Brad: You look just like your dad.

17
00:01:02.681 --> 00:01:05.183
Bello: I think that is a compliment!

18
00:01:06.385 --> 00:01:07.646
Danny: But I don't understand.

19
00:01:08.346 --> 00:01:09.247
How did you get here?

20
00:01:09.267 --> 00:01:11.309
Danny: Is Hopian here too?

21
00:01:11.329 --> 00:01:14.772
Tina: We can talk later.

22
00:01:15.472 --> 00:01:16.333
Bello is right.

23
00:01:16.914 --> 00:01:18.335
We have to get out of here!

24
00:01:18.355 --> 00:01:22.799
Brad: Do you think we are locked in?

25
00:01:22.819 --> 00:01:25.161
Tina: Let's give the gate a push.

26
00:01:25.181 --> 00:01:28.824
Danny: It's open!

27
00:01:29.972 --> 00:01:35.455
Bello: I guess when Tina yelled, the mites ran to the tower so quickly [n3@that they forgot to

28
00:01:35.515 --> 00:01:36.256
lock the gate.

29
00:01:38.517 --> 00:01:41.498
Tina: We'd better get out of here fast.

30
00:01:41.518 --> 00:01:43.319
Bello: Run, run.

31
00:01:43.339 --> 00:01:45.461
Danny Brad: Run for it.

32
00:01:45.481 --> 00:01:52.624
Danny: It's so good to see you, Bello.

33
00:01:53.305 --> 00:01:54.245
What are you doing here?

34
00:01:54.265 --> 00:01:55.226
Brad: Yeah.

35
00:01:55.446 --> 00:01:56.587
How did you find us?

36
00:01:57.347 --> 00:01:58.708
Bello: I'll let Tina explain.

37
00:01:59.364 --> 00:02:00.525
I'm here thanks to her.

38
00:02:00.545 --> 00:02:06.108
Tina: Bello and I came looking for you two because [n3@you were so angry at the bullies.

39
00:02:06.128 --> 00:02:09.250
Tina: I thought you were going to do something stupid.

40
00:02:09.270 --> 00:02:12.031
Danny: Who are you calling stupid?

41
00:02:12.051 --> 00:02:14.633
Brad: Danny, calm down.

42
00:02:14.653 --> 00:02:17.795
Tina: This is what I'm talking about.

43
00:02:17.815 --> 00:02:21.117
Tina: You were so angry that you wouldn't listen to me.

44
00:02:21.137 --> 00:02:23.978
Tina: I thought maybe you would listen to Hopian.

45
00:02:23.998 --> 00:02:29.121
Bello: But my father is too old now, so I decided to help instead.

46
00:02:29.141 --> 00:02:33.642
Danny: But, Bello, you're just as small as us!

47
00:02:34.322 --> 00:02:35.222
Bello: I know.

48
00:02:35.802 --> 00:02:37.283
We don't know how it happened.

49
00:02:38.483 --> 00:02:40.504
Tina: We found something in the schoolyard.

50
00:02:41.364 --> 00:02:42.804
It was some kind of gun.

51
00:02:42.824 --> 00:02:45.625
Brad: You must have found my shrink gun.

52
00:02:45.645 --> 00:02:48.666
Brad: It shrunk the bullies, but then it shrunk us.

53
00:02:48.686 --> 00:02:51.547
Bello: And then it shrunk us too!

54
00:02:51.587 --> 00:02:55.808
Brad: It's not my best invention, I guess.

55
00:02:57.072 --> 00:02:59.574
Danny: I don't think you should enter it in the science fair.

56
00:02:59.594 --> 00:03:02.355
Brad: No, I wouldn't get an "A" on it.

57
00:03:02.835 --> 00:03:07.358
Bello: Wait a minute!

58
00:03:08.059 --> 00:03:10.260
You said the shrink gun shrunk the bullies.

59
00:03:10.280 --> 00:03:11.901
Danny Brad: Yes.

60
00:03:11.921 --> 00:03:14.562
Tina: Then I have a question.

61
00:03:15.443 --> 00:03:16.343
Where are they?
